  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Media assessment Liberia</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Media assessment Liberia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ambassaden i Monrovi ska genomf&#xf6;ra en kartl&#xe4;ggning av mediekt&#xf6;rer i landet. Studien syftar till att identifiera ing&#xe5;ngar f&#xf6;r Sverige f&#xf6;r att st&#xe4;rka fri, professionell och obereonde media som kan bidra till &#xf6;kad transparens, ansvarsutkr&#xe4;vande och st&#xe4;rkande av m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter.

Ambassaden i Monrovia anv&#xe4;nder ramavtalet f&#xf6;r demokrati och m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter f&#xf6;r att genomf&#xf6;ra denna studie.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment seeks to do an assessment of the media landscape in Liberia, and current media development efforts, with a particular focus on if and how Sweden can add value to the ambitions to strengthen independent, professional media and its role in enhancing and protecting human rights, transparency and accountability. 

The Embassy in Monrovia uses the framework agreement for democracy and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
